<title>USA: Gulfstream Aero. reaches pension pact-PBGC.</title>
<headline>Gulfstream Aero. reaches pension pact-PBGC.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulfstream Aerospace Corp will add $120 million over five years to its three underfunded pensions, the Pension Benefit Guaranty Corp said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company worked out an agreement with PBGC over the pensions that cover 5,600 workers and retirees, PBGC said.</p>
<p>Gulfstream agreed to contribute additional funds at the time of its initial public offering, PBGC said.</p>
</text>
